OL,5,G1400 Record Review
OL,6,     FAndrew McGregor with the best of
OL,7,     Fthe week's new classical releases,
OL,8,     Fjoined by Marina Frolova-Walker
OL,9,     Fand Jeremy Summerly, who surveys
OL,10,     Frecordings of Handel's Semele.
OL,11,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,12,     FEdith Bowman presents a haunting
OL,13,     Fselection of the best film scores
OL,14,     Fand soundtracks. Featuring a
OL,15,     Fspecial interview with composer
OL,16,     FAnna Meredith about her score to
OL,17,     F'Wicker'.
